<entry>
    <title>猿回し～神無月祭～</title>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/2024/1022_173945.html" />
    <id>tag:www.supercourt.jp,2024:/blog/sawaragi//41.18435</id>

    <published>2024-10-22T08:39:45Z</published>
    <updated>2024-10-22T23:08:20Z</updated>

    <summary>皆さんこんにちは！ さくら通りですU*^ᴥ ^*U 本日はこの間、予告しました月...</summary>
    <author>
        <name>茨木沢良宜</name>
        
    </author>
    
        <category term="ご入居者日記" scheme="http://www.sixapart.com/ns/types#category" />
    
        <category term="スタッフ日記" scheme="http://www.sixapart.com/ns/types#category" />
    
        <category term="レクリエーション" scheme="http://www.sixapart.com/ns/types#category" />
    
        <category term="地域交流" scheme="http://www.sixapart.com/ns/types#category" />
    
    
    <content type="html" xml:lang="ja" xml:base="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/">
        <![CDATA[<p>皆さんこんにちは！</p>
<p>さくら通りですU*^ᴥ ^*U</p>
<p></p>
<p>本日はこの間、予告しました月祭のご様子です！</p>
<p></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_135632.jpg"><img alt="20241021_135632.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_135632-thumb-autox1333-225550.jpg" width="600" height="1333" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>神戸モンキーズより5歳のタオくんですU*＞ᴥ ＜*U</p>
<p>タオくんようこそ～！</p>
<p></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_135741.jpg"><img alt="20241021_135741.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_135741-thumb-autox1333-225556.jpg" width="600" height="1333" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>とっても賢そうなタオくんです！</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/fdb9635eaae968563daf95f4bcc7e55313942009.jpg"><img alt="20241021_135713.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/fdb9635eaae968563daf95f4bcc7e55313942009-thumb-600xauto-225560.jpg" width="600" height="270" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/ede89d3fac656d96ee76ec544580c18f67ff174c.jpg"><img alt="20241021_135806.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/ede89d3fac656d96ee76ec544580c18f67ff174c-thumb-autox1333-225568.jpg" width="600" height="1333" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>何が始まるかドキドキですね！</p>
<p></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_140045.jpg"><img alt="20241021_140045.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_140045-thumb-autox800-225574.jpg" width="600" height="800" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>さあ！始まりました！</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_140307.jpg"><img alt="20241021_140307.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_140307-thumb-600xauto-225576.jpg" width="600" height="450" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>皆さんお猿のタオ君に期待のまなざしです！</p>
<p></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_140424.jpg"><img alt="20241021_140424.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_140424-thumb-autox1333-225578.jpg" width="600" height="1333" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>タオ君高跳びに挑戦です！</p>
<p></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_140427.jpg"><img alt="20241021_140427.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_140427-thumb-600xauto-225582.jpg" width="600" height="450" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_141844.jpg"><img alt="20241021_141844.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_141844-thumb-600xauto-225584.jpg" width="600" height="450" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_140836.jpg"><img alt="20241021_140836.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_140836-thumb-600xauto-225586.jpg" width="600" height="450" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_141647%280%29.jpg"><img alt="20241021_141647(0).jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_141647%280%29-thumb-autox1333-225588.jpg" width="600" height="1333" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>ジャンプに竹馬なんでもできちゃいます！</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p>最後はタオくんと皆さんで記念撮影ですU*^ᴥ ^*U</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_142216.jpg"><img alt="20241021_142216.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_142216-thumb-600xauto-225592.jpg" width="600" height="450" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_142238.jpg"><img alt="20241021_142238.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_142238-thumb-600xauto-225597.jpg" width="600" height="450" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_142301.jpg"><img alt="20241021_142301.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_142301-thumb-600xauto-225601.jpg" width="600" height="270" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_142335.jpg"><img alt="20241021_142335.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_142335-thumb-600xauto-225603.jpg" width="600" height="450" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/20241021_142420.jpg"><img alt="20241021_142420.jpg" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/10/20241021_142420-thumb-600xauto-225605.jpg" width="600" height="450" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p>今回も楽しい月祭になりましたね！</p>
<p>来月もお楽しみにU*^ᴥ ^*U</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
