<entry>
    <title>普段のレクリエーションの様子</title>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/2024/0925_102703.html" />
    <id>tag:www.supercourt.jp,2024:/blog/sawaragi//41.17633</id>

    <published>2024-09-25T01:27:03Z</published>
    <updated>2024-09-25T02:02:33Z</updated>

    <summary> 皆さんこんにちは！ さくら通りですU*^ᴥ ^*U ブログの閲覧ありがとうござ...</summary>
    <author>
        <name>茨木沢良宜</name>
        
    </author>
    
        <category term="ご入居者日記" scheme="http://www.sixapart.com/ns/types#category" />
    
        <category term="レクリエーション" scheme="http://www.sixapart.com/ns/types#category" />
    
    
    <content type="html" xml:lang="ja" xml:base="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/">
        <![CDATA[<p></p>
<p>皆さんこんにちは！</p>
<p>さくら通りですU*^ᴥ ^*U</p>
<p>ブログの閲覧ありがとうございます。</p>
<p>本日は体操レクの様子をブログにしました！</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0673-219269.html" onclick="window.open('https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0673-219269.html','popup','width=3107,height=2449,scrollbars=yes,resizable=no,toolbar=no,directories=no,location=no,menubar=no,status=no,left=0,top=0'); return false"><img src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0673-thumb-350xauto-219269.jpg" width="400" height="315" alt="IMG_0673.JPG" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0675%5B1%5D-219272.html" onclick="window.open('https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0675%5B1%5D-219272.html','popup','width=3264,height=2449,scrollbars=yes,resizable=no,toolbar=no,directories=no,location=no,menubar=no,status=no,left=0,top=0'); return false"><img src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0675%5B1%5D-thumb-400xauto-219272.jpg" width="400" height="300" alt="IMG_0675[1].JPG" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>最初は皆さん、深呼吸を行いますよ━。</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0658-219280.html" onclick="window.open('https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0658-219280.html','popup','width=2664,height=2449,scrollbars=yes,resizable=no,toolbar=no,directories=no,location=no,menubar=no,status=no,left=0,top=0'); return false"><img src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0658-thumb-400xauto-219280.jpg" width="400" height="368" alt="IMG_0658.JPG" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p><img alt="IMG_0677[1].JPG" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/IMG_0677%5B1%5D.JPG" width="400" height="318" class="mt-image-none" /></p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0678%5B1%5D-219285.html" onclick="window.open('https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0678%5B1%5D-219285.html','popup','width=3060,height=2441,scrollbars=yes,resizable=no,toolbar=no,directories=no,location=no,menubar=no,status=no,left=0,top=0'); return false"><img src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0678%5B1%5D-thumb-400xauto-219285.jpg" width="400" height="319" alt="IMG_0678[1].JPG" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>手の運動にええわ～</p>
<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0661%5B1%5D-219288.html" onclick="window.open('https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0661%5B1%5D-219288.html','popup','width=2162,height=2449,scrollbars=yes,resizable=no,toolbar=no,directories=no,location=no,menubar=no,status=no,left=0,top=0'); return false"><img src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sawaragi/assets_c/2024/09/IMG_0661%5B1%5D-thumb-autox453-219288.jpg" width="400" height="453" alt="IMG_0661[1].JPG" class="mt-image-none" /></a></p>
<p>少し腰をかがめてます。</p>
